<icon name="..."> takes a Bootstrap Icons id (https://icons.getbootstrap.com, v1.11.3, MIT) or the
name of an .svg in the project's icons/ folder (it wins over a Bootstrap name). 1em square, colored by
`color`; size it with `font-size` or `width`/`height`. `j3c doc j3ui icons` has the details.

